# The backend image is built from the repo root (see backend/Dockerfile), so without this the whole
# repo, frontend and test fixtures included, would be sent as context. Everything is out unless named.
*
!backend/
!shared/money/
!gradle/libs.versions.toml
!config/

**/.gradle
**/build
**/.kotlin
backend/*.md
# The money module's tests and their fixtures are not part of the image.
shared/money/src/commonTest
shared/money/src/jvmTest
